<<<
The abstract noun, = anonymity &c., is incognito only, with possible plural incognitos (never dropping their incognitos, or usually incognito).
===
The abstract noun, = anonymity &c., is *incognito* only, with possible plural *incognitos* (never *dropping their incognitos,* or usually *incognito*).
>>>

<<<
The adverb or predicative adjective (travelling i.) is usually -to irrespective of gender & number; if declined, it is like the personal noun.
===
The adverb or predicative adjective (*travelling i.*) is usually *-to* irrespective of gender & number; if declined, it is like the personal noun.
>>>

